WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:02.908
Open Sunsama works with any AI agent

2
00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:04.773
Claude, ChatGPT

3
00:00:04.793 --> 00:00:06.867
Cursor, and more can plan your day with you

4
00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:10.510
In Settings, open the MCP tab

5
00:00:10.945 --> 00:00:12.010
Copy the connector URL

6
00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.020
Paste it into Claude

7
00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.008
or ChatGPT as a new connector

8
00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:19.962
Sign in once, then choose Allow access

9
00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.198
There is no API key to paste

10
00:00:23.963 --> 00:00:24.687
Now just ask

11
00:00:25.195 --> 00:00:27.207
Plan my afternoon around the launch review

12
00:00:28.843 --> 00:00:30.584
The agent reads your day first

13
00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:33.383
Then it adds tasks and time blocks

14
00:00:33.403 --> 00:00:35.218
and they appear in the app as it works

15
00:00:37.007 --> 00:00:38.305
You stay in charge

16
00:00:38.325 --> 00:00:40.235
Move or change anything you like

17
00:00:40.743 --> 00:00:42.610
And since Open Sunsama is open source

18
00:00:43.017 --> 00:00:43.207
you can

19
00:00:43.227 --> 00:00:45.535
see exactly what your agent is allowed to do

